<%# Aluni's inline SVG twin: the same seedling as the 3D character at growth stage 2 (soil disc, the open seed coat, the hypocotyl, two cotyledons, the bud's gold glow, the first true leaves), drawn flat for places without WebGL or room for the stage. No face. Colours are the mascot tokens so it follows the theme. No text nodes: the label is the aria-label. Local `size:` is one of sm | md | lg | xl. %>
